# Advance FIFA Soccer 2004 into an active match and exercise player controls.
repeat Start 120 120 12 5
repeat A 180 120 28 5
repeat Down 2400 120 6 8
repeat A 2520 120 10 5
repeat Right 4200 120 4 8
repeat A 4320 120 10 5
repeat A 6000 180 16 5
at 8200 A,Right 900
at 9800 B,Left 600
at 11200 A,Up 900
press 13000 Up
